อออออออออออออออออออออออออออต USE-OF-ITEM COMMANDS ฦออออออออออออออออออออออออออ

CTRL-K          Key             Try to unlock a door with a key
CTRL-U          Use             Utilize a miscellaneous item in your pack
c               Call            Label something for future reference
d               Drop            Put an item from your pack onto the floor
e               Eat             Eat some food
p               Put on          Put on or remove a ring from a hand
q               Quaff           Drink a potion
r               Read            Read a scroll
t               Throw           Throw an object
w               Wield           Use an item as a weapon
x               Exchange        Swap secondary weapon for right-hand weapon
z               Zap             Point and zap a wand, rod, or staff
I               Ignite          Ignite a wall torch
S               Strap           Strap on or unstrap a shield from your arm
W               Wear            Strap on or take off a suit of armor
X               Set             Signify your secondary weapon
